<title>USA: Basis for sustained non-inflationary growth-Rivlin.</title>
<headline>Basis for sustained non-inflationary growth-Rivlin.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The economy is providing the foundation for sustained, non-inflationary growth now, Federal Reserve Vice Chair Alice Rivlin said on Thursdaay.</p>
<p>&quot;I think we're at a fortunate point,&quot; she told the National Community Reinvestment Coalition. &quot;The economy is providing the basis for sustained, non-inflationary growth.&quot;</p>
</text>
